## §12 Viral & Meta-Layer Architecture **[growth]**

Optional retention hooks for puzzle/logic games — **do not** mention Daily Challenge or share in the Play listing unless implemented and discoverable (§13):

- **Daily seed mode:** Deterministic level from `YYYYMMDD` so all players share one puzzle per day.
- **Share loop:** `navigator.share` with emoji grid or score text after a win.

If listed on Play, the mode must be reachable from the main UI without finishing the full campaign.

