## §16 ASO & Design Tooling **[core]**

When preparing graphics for the Google Play Console, use these validated tools to ensure platform compliance:

- **Screenshots:** Use [appscreenshotskit.com](https://appscreenshotskit.com) to generate polished device mockups for the Play Store gallery.
- **Icons:** Use [easyappicon.com](https://easyappicon.com) to generate pixel-perfect adaptive Android icons (`ic_launcher` layers).
- **Feature Graphic:** Use [screenshot-maker.appinstitute.com](https://screenshot-maker.appinstitute.com) to consistently generate compliant `1024x500` Google Play feature graphics.
